{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡實體疑似及轉音者，先為注明，以便檢閱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音支，但也。祇如、祇有皆用此。今為秖，非。又音岐，神祇也。凡祇夜、祇陀本此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音止，側也，擊也。扺對\n之扺當用此，葢以手擊節而對。今作秖祇，皆誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "便入聲，為別異、別離之別；又音鼈，為分別、辨別之別。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡稱譽、稱歎則平聲，凡名稱、相稱則去聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如行止、運行，音衡。德行、言行，音幸。行列、行布，音杭。行\n其事以利人，音恨。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "几，結解。解說則上聲，又去聲，音械，曉也。如曉了自脫曰解脫，曉悟其義曰解義。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "池稚二音，凡未治而治之則平聲，已治之治則去聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音竊是切當真切之切，又去聲。音砌。眾也。\n又大凡也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡別離、支離，皆平聲，又去聲，音利，漸相違也。離欲、離垢，皆從此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如周旋、折旋、旋轉，皆\n平聲，又去聲，乃逐旋之旋。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "濟度之度則去聲，又入聲，音鐸計度之度。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "懦，平聲，禪那、檀那從此。又\n上聲，奴可切，為那裏、那事之那。又上聲，奴臥切，語餘之聲也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下奉上曰養，則去聲。生養、畜養、自養，\n皆上聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "來去則去聲，除去則上聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲，言語也。又以言告人曰語，即去聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "欠之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云無比"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即藏、通、別、圓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "台教分頓、漸、祕密、不定、藏、通、別、圓也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "賢首分小、始、終、頓、圓也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊稱十二部經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即經藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說往事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說昔受生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重宣其義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第九白淨識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說四\n阿含"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即普賢觀經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此並戴佛祖統記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "統攝諸法曰圓，直入佛地曰頓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六朝翻譯諸師，皆非淺識之士。翻譯場中，有譯語者，\n有譯義者，有潤文者，有證梵語者，有證義者，有唐梵相校者。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "昔漢亦有費長房，乃\n地仙也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法眼嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲門\n嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲居祐嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經作相字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經作動字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同寂。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲，軍後曰殿。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音藥，鎻鑰。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音樗，戶樞，又樞機也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音初。苾蒭，西域\n香艸，以僧況之，遂為名。今稱比丘，義同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音秋，水鳥，似鶴。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音昔，分也，如斤破木之義。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音蠻，\n以華作冠曰華鬘，今音瞞。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音祝，視也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "涓熒切，迴平聲，祕藏也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "申上聲，況也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音覲，\n纔也。祇，有也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音延，研磨也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音乞，問也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音福，重也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音核，考之使實也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音皮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音騰，移書傳鈔也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音疽。沮渠氏，複姓。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音扶，草名。晉蒲洪之孫名堅，背有艸付字，遂改\n姓苻，建國號秦，故稱苻秦。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音杭，渡也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音雍。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音塚。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音抽，病愈也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音檄，能齋肅以\n事神者，在男曰覡，在女曰巫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音叔。倐忽，俗作倐。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音善，腨腸即足肚。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與敷同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音客，約定日期也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蒲上聲，以簡策記言曰簿徒。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "含去聲，恨也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋義曰：訓"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音位。縱曰經，橫曰緯。又定者為經，動者為緯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一云三昧樂正受"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢鉢羅乃樹名，\n佛於此樹下成菩提道，故得是名。然因山窟中有樹，遂名其窟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出大智度論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北末切，半入聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "爾者切，音惹。般若、蘭若皆從此。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謙，去聲。呵欠，開口呵氣也。又欠伸，意闌則\n欠，體疲則伸。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音恰，張口貌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攀去聲，目顧也，俗作盻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即伊字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音著，記物曰注，\n與註同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音朴，糟滓也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音倔。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音袖，鳥名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音察，旛柱也。有能得一法，即建旛告遠，故\n稱剎。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音渠瞿曇，佛姓。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音乾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音朵。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音麗，比也，類也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音獺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音莽。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音攝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音遷，咸也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "邦，入聲。博，地大也。博，學廣也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音豆，以言投機也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音演。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音遘，取牛乳也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音蘇，牛乳為之。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音洛，乳漿。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音提。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音乎，醍醐酪之精液。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音藝，割也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音府，下也，\n曲也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音床，不擇而食也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自正正人曰匡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "焦上聲，勦除也，今誤作勦。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音帝。精義入神\n曰諦。如真諦、聖諦、諦觀、諦聽、諦當之類。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音濁，拔也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和，去聲，猛然自省之聲，又與哇同，即人初\n\n生落地之聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "徹上聲，發明也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音瞞。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音憨，顢頇蒙昧不明之狀。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音壟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音通，儱侗\n不能辨析也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音嚴，俗作粘。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音屑，楔子，破木之錐"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一作梨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有本\n無世字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開思合見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開見合思，見八十八使，思十使，共九十八使"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見八\n十八使，思八十一品"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "摧上聲，折抑也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音極，尤甚也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音子，濁也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音惠，怒也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "辰上聲，大蛤也，雉入\n海所化，能吐氣化為樓臺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "判也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音裕，猶豫，獸名，性多疑者。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音允，亡也，墜也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北藏作也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自覺聖智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北藏作空心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與豫同，干也，在也，及也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音治，幼小也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同玩閒觀取適也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "坤入\n聲窟穴。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音盲，艸始生芽也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音酧，計算也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "篇入聲，忽然一見也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音雞羈繫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音瑣，俗作鏁。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "都含切，答平聲，愛戀也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音耐。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "堪去聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音癸，法也，循也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北藏\n無羅字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三途并修羅為四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音薩。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音忌，及也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音戒，懶也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "待，上聲，慢倦也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音必。受記成佛，謂之記莂，喻如種禾\n移蒔也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音詮，取魚器。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音題兔網。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音博，肩膊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音潘。俗作󱁲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音亦。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音奎，\n大之也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與擴同。張小使大謂之廓。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音纊，空濶也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐，去聲，廣遠也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "流通本作心生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北藏作也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云無垢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云白淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見後本覺利品中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音料，治病也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "爭去聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音博，色不純也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音刎，脣邊曰吻。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音丙，除也，與迸同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呈錦切，上聲。線縫處。又帝王自稱曰朕。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音趙，與𠧞同，事先見也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音麥，躍身上馬之狀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲，具也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲，有罪自陳曰首。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音暄，譁也，囂也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "汀上聲，聳直貌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音噩。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音夾，\n肩脾。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音舛，息在心胸之圓則嚙。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音糞，鳥忽飛起貌，又力舉也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音信，疾也。又與奮同。奮亦\n音信，鳥之張羽自奮也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藏本無所字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "流通本有遠離諸欲刺一句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北藏作也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "庵，上聲，梵語也。經中稱唵摩羅、唵摩羅、阿摩羅，乃譯人語音少異耳。又唵字是一切真言之母，含無\n量法門，即是無相法界也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音兼，封固也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疽上聲，抑也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音惻測度。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音流，瑠璃，俗作\n琉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "森，去聲，滲漏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嗔去聲，踐也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音觸，眾獸皆曰畜。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音倫，沒也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "垂，去聲，隕\n落也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音妹，迷昧也。又鬼名。有魑魅魍魎兩種。魑魅四足，好迷惑人，山林異氣所生，乃精怪之物。魍魎\n為川澤之神。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音紐，鼻紐。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "求去聲，過愆也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音劬。渠渠，力言不已也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云一切種智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北藏作惻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與軟同。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音邑，酌也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音惻，度量也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "改平聲。括：盡也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音狄，面見也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音謝。\n借也。又與籍同。如狼藉從艸，典籍從竹。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音寧，不散貌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音藺，慳也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音姤，結構。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "榮定\n切，去聲。潔也。一作摩。瑩，皎然也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音古，吹撼也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音溪，不正也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "含，上聲，搖動也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音怱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音尺，黜也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音出，忽然也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼卷切近變。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "閑，上聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云方便善巧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北藏作崖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云保解脫，又云淨命，又云成就威儀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云相向說罪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語阿󳺎跋致"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "得可意事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "失可意事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不現誹撥"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不現讚美"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "現前讚美"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "現前誹撥"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "逼惱身心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "適悅身心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音却，與慤同，誠也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音徙。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上去二聲，方術也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音詣。凡九流百工，業皆曰藝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "水際曰涯。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "山邊。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音力，點滿曰瀝，水將盡而餘滴也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音蟹，驚也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "潘入聲，散水曰潑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音六，轉換不定也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音昏，心不明也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音皮。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音甜，閒靜也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音廷，水止曰渟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音非誹撥，謂言行不然也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "追去聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音由，瘤也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音范，模範。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音孽，萌櫱。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音迂，澤中\n穢泥"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從下丹田而上，觸胸、喉、舌、唇、齒、齗，以及于頂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北藏無者字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性空智海"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乾上聲，數也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音侔，兵器。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "豚，上聲。矛盾，兩兵持犯也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音中，折衷斷其中也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "駝上\n聲，怠也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音銀，齒根肉也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音善，獨專也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "迢，上聲，搖動貌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音據，急卒也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音你，\n語後指實其事之聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "粗去聲，處置也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音預，有益于後曰󱚉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是意識中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "我即人也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如是\n三昧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北藏作目字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藏本作長者梵行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音斛，細紗也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "瞞髮美貌，又夫人名勝鬘。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "官入聲，包括。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寫平聲，少也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音淨，\n掘地為陷也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音局。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音四，潛候其隙也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音縻，繫也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音預，以言慰之也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "仍也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音刀，忉利天名，在須彌山頂。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲，勤也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音擾，亂也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "簾入聲，踰跨也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音密，靜也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即普賢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俗名九華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北藏誤作七五"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北藏誤作八六"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "草平聲操守。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以制切。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音忽，恍惚不定也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唾上聲，安怙也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即文殊別名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如毋字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "苦洽切，音掐。適當之辭，謂有合於心也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音賣，老也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音寫傾潟。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音腫，故墓也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "掃本字。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音團捏聚。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "色洽切，聚食聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音戟，急速也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "饒上聲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音菴，悉也，曉也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行者作觀，當想普賢菩薩禮佛發願\n偈云：我今五輪禮佛足，為斷五道離五葢。願令一切諸眾生，安住五通具五眼。願我右膝著地時，令諸眾\n生得正覺。願我左膝著地時，令諸眾生離邪見。願我右手著地時，如佛坐于金剛座，右手指地為震動，一\n時疾證大菩提。願我左手著地時，攝諸外道入正道。願我頭頂著地時，令諸眾生離憍慢，成就如來無見\n\n頂。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "偈云：真空法性如虗空，出世智寶難思議。我身應現法寶前，五體翹勤皈命禮。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文殊菩薩作觀偈云：能禮\n所禮性空寂，感應道交難思議。我此道場如帝珠，某號菩薩應現中。我身應現菩薩前，頭面接足皈命禮。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "我與眾生，無量劫來，以識心妄緣，多起愛染。由內外使，隨使流轉。造諸一切不善之業，輪廻三界，無\n\n有出期。而本有如來藏性，皆為生滅。慮知相隱，理不顯故。于如來所說一味真實決定了義之法，障\n蔽不聞。況千思萬慮，不益道理。徒為亂動，失本心王。今一念悔過，向佛發露。惟願加被，令罪障消滅。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "我與眾生無始至今，一念心動五陰俱生，五陰生中具五十惡，多行不善溺于欲刺，繫于業緣常被\n纏縛，失于自性本覺，失于如來出世智寶，不發四弘誓願，不發無上道心。今者幸得如來金剛三昧\n智力，知三界虗幻諸法空寂，無我我所，能所身見內外結使皆悉寂靜，惟是識心妄見而有。願從今\n已去，心住中道而不傾倚，六塵緣影而無流易，于一切法無著無求不取不捨，性等金剛不壞自性，\n三寶清淨光明之體，四緣如順三戒具足，以自在智入于實際，得佛智慧法義皆空，自利利人過三\n界地，不住二乘入菩薩道，亦如諸大菩薩化度眾生而無化度之想。我願如是，唯願如來慈悲攝受。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡持是經者，當日夕敬禮，其起止稱本師佛號，餘準常儀，茲不贅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T54n2128_p0425a09"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "X16n0318_p0889c08"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X40n0719_p0397a20"}
{"id": null, "n": "0283001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0283001", "type": "orig", "text": "滅疑減"}
